title: "From Multimodal Sensing to Warranted Whole-Person Inference: A Human-Function-Based Measurement-to-Claim Specification and Falsifiable Validation Protocol"
authors:
  - family-names: "Che"
    given-names: "Lei"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-8143-1675"
    affiliation: "MoveTips Technology (Beijing) Co., Ltd."
