repository-code: "https://github.com/dlehche/Human-Function-World-Model/tree/main/papers/multimodal-sensing-to-warranted-inference"
abstract: >-
  Proposes a question-scoped measurement-to-claim specification connecting validated
  multimodal observations to evidence-qualified claims about one person's
  internal/external demands, available bodily capacity, actual functional
  engagement and consequences. Defines three conditional qualification gates,
  identifiability checks, event/knowledge-time revision and falsifiable validation
  against information-matched strong baselines. No new independently validated
  sensing, human outcomes, prospective forecast or clinical benefit is reported.
keywords:
  - whole-person computation
  - human function
  - HFWM
  - UOHF
